# Example requests for every endpoint: happy path first, then error cases.
# Start the API with `dotnet run --project src/MeterDataService.Api` (Development seeds MaLo 41373559241).
# OpenAPI: {{host}}/openapi/v1.json   Scalar UI: {{host}}/scalar/v1

@host = http://localhost:5227
@maLo = 41373559241

### ── Import ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Queue a CSV file for import → 202 Accepted + Location header
# The sample day (2026-06-10) has a spike at 18:30 and a missing 03:00 value; both get interpolated.
POST {{host}}/api/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="marketLocationId"

{{maLo}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="household-one-day.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/household-one-day.csv
--boundary--

### Poll the job status (replace the id with the one from the Location header) → 200
GET {{host}}/api/import/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Error: invalid MaLo-ID (wrong check digit) → 400
POST {{host}}/api/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="marketLocationId"

41373559242
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="household-one-day.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/household-one-day.csv
--boundary--

### Error: unknown job id → 404
GET {{host}}/api/import/0199b9a1-0000-7000-8000-000000000000

### ── Market locations (Marktlokationen) ───────────────────────────────────

### List market locations, first page → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations?offset=0&limit=50

### Error: page size out of range (1–500) → 400
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations?limit=0

### One market location with meter locations, installed meter and series → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}

### Error: MaLo-ID with a wrong check digit → 400
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/41373559242

### Error: valid MaLo-ID that is not registered → 404
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/10000000009

### ── Measurements (Lastgang) ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15-minute values of the sample day with status and substitution trace → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/measurements?from=2026-06-10&to=2026-06-10

### Hourly sums of the sample day → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/measurements?from=2026-06-10&to=2026-06-10&granularity=Hour

### Error: more than 31 days of 15-minute values → 400
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/measurements?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-07-15

### Error: 'to' before 'from' → 400
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/measurements?from=2026-06-10&to=2026-06-09

### ── Consumption (Energiemenge) ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Daily totals of June with completeness → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/consumption?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-30

### Monthly totals of 2026 → 200
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/consumption?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&granularity=Month

### Error: QuarterHour is not a consumption granularity (use /measurements) → 400
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/{{maLo}}/consumption?from=2026-06-10&to=2026-06-10&granularity=QuarterHour

### Error: unknown market location → 404
GET {{host}}/api/market-locations/10000000009/consumption?from=2026-06-01&to=2026-06-30
